# ==============================================================================
# AI Butler — .gitignore
# ==============================================================================

# ---- Binaries ----
# NOTE: anchored to the repo root. Unanchored rules like `aibutler` would also
# match `deploy/helm/aibutler/` — see https://git-scm.com/docs/gitignore for
# why leading slashes matter.
/aibutler
/aibutler.exe
/integration.test
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test

# ---- Build output ----
/dist/
/tmp/
/build/
*.out

# ---- Go tooling ----
vendor/
coverage.out
*.coverprofile
__debug_bin*

# ---- Secrets — NEVER commit ----
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx

# ---- AI Butler runtime data ----
# NOTE: these are runtime data paths, NOT the Go source packages.
# Do NOT use unanchored rules like `vault/` which would match internal/vault/
# (the Go package for credential storage).
.aibutler/
/data/
/vault/
/backups/
/sessions/
/tmp/
*.backup

# ---- IDE / editor ----
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.claude/

# ---- OS junk ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# ---- Node.js (vscode-extension + other JS subprojects) ----
node_modules/
vscode-extension/out/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ---- Website lives in a separate repo (LumabyteCo/aibutler-website) ----
website/

# ---- Astro build cache (stray) ----
.astro/

# ---- Temp / scratch ----
*.tmp
*.bak
scratch/

# ---- Local-only docs ----
# Roadmap convention: CHANGELOG.md [Unreleased] is the canonical
# version-pinned plan. Other roadmap files stay local until ready.
/docs/ROADMAP.md

# ---- Draft docs (not yet published) ----
# Convention: write new docs as `*.draft.md` while iterating. Rename to
# drop the `.draft` suffix when the file is ready for the repo.
*.draft.md
